{"id":"c60a11e47ac58326","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-gentzen-system.md","title":"Gentzen System","display":"df-gentzen-system — Gentzen System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-gentzen-system","aliases":["72-df-gentzen-system"],"display":"df-gentzen-system — Gentzen System","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-axiom]]","[[72-df-structural-rule]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule-left]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule-right]]","[[72-df-sequent-right-forall]]","[[72-df-sequent-left-exists]]","[[72-df-cut-rule]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§1.2.2,1.2.13,2.3.2 print11–12,16,32/PDF23–24,28,44; standard LJ single-succedent disjunction variant","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-gentzen-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-gentzen-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gentzen-system — Gentzen System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b6882ca0a0cd075f\" href=\"?note=b6882ca0a0cd075f\" title=\"72-df-sequent-axiom\">72-df-sequent-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07987a632b1cbf1a\" href=\"?note=07987a632b1cbf1a\" title=\"72-df-structural-rule\">72-df-structural-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a33e42c998217a52\" href=\"?note=a33e42c998217a52\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule-left\">72-df-sequent-rule-left</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b054542d6df6b206\" href=\"?note=b054542d6df6b206\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule-right\">72-df-sequent-rule-right</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cf4099999609d5eb\" href=\"?note=cf4099999609d5eb\" title=\"72-df-sequent-right-forall\">72-df-sequent-right-forall</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"55bc01ae9fd27543\" href=\"?note=55bc01ae9fd27543\" title=\"72-df-sequent-left-exists\">72-df-sequent-left-exists</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2a94e54a928b642a\" href=\"?note=2a94e54a928b642a\" title=\"72-df-cut-rule\">72-df-cut-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§1.2.2,1.2.13,2.3.2 print11–12,16,32/PDF23–24,28,44; standard LJ single-succedent disjunction variant"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的五分量签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\">\\(X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限序列以自然数为定义域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Gamma\">\\(A,\\Gamma\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma\\)</span>。多个逗号按次序串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的语法有序对。</li>\n<li>本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b6882ca0a0cd075f\" href=\"?note=b6882ca0a0cd075f\" title=\"72-df-sequent-axiom\">72-df-sequent-axiom</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"07987a632b1cbf1a\" href=\"?note=07987a632b1cbf1a\" title=\"72-df-structural-rule\">72-df-structural-rule</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J=\\{\\bot L,\\neg L,\\land L,\\lor L,\\to L,\\forall L,\\exists R,\\top R,\\neg R,\\land R,\\lor R,\\to R\\}\">\\(\\mathcal J=\\{\\bot L,\\neg L,\\land L,\\lor L,\\to L,\\forall L,\\exists R,\\top R,\\neg R,\\land R,\\lor R,\\to R\\}\\)</span> 是以下公式中枚举的规则关系族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_R\">\\(t_R\\)</span> 为与各关系名对应的固定互异标签。</li>\n<li>演算是三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span>，规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R\">\\(\\mathsf R\\)</span> 使用带标签四元实例；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{cut}\">\\(\\mathsf{cut}\\)</span> 专供Cut标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_\\Sigma:=\\operatorname{LeftRules}_{\\mathsf{LK}}\\cup\\operatorname{RightRules}_{\\mathsf{LK}},\\qquad\\widehat{\\mathrm{Logic}}_\\Sigma:=\\bigcup_{R\\in\\mathcal J}\\operatorname{Lift}_{t_R}(R)\\cup\\widehat{\\forall R}\\cup\\widehat{\\exists L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Logic}_\\Sigma:=\\operatorname{LeftRules}_{\\mathsf{LK}}\\cup\\operatorname{RightRules}_{\\mathsf{LK}},\\qquad\\widehat{\\mathrm{Logic}}_\\Sigma:=\\bigcup_{R\\in\\mathcal J}\\operatorname{Lift}_{t_R}(R)\\cup\\widehat{\\forall R}\\cup\\widehat{\\exists L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rules}(\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle):=\\mathsf R,\\qquad\\operatorname{Ax}(\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle):=\\mathsf{Ax}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rules}(\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle):=\\mathsf R,\\qquad\\operatorname{Ax}(\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle):=\\mathsf{Ax}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma:=\\langle\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma),\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma,\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\\cup\\widehat{\\mathrm{Logic}}_\\Sigma\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma:=\\langle\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma),\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma,\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\\cup\\widehat{\\mathrm{Logic}}_\\Sigma\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle+\\mathcal U:=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\cup\\{r\\in\\mathcal U:\\operatorname{Seqs}(r)\\subseteq Q\\}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma:=\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma+\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle+\\mathcal U:=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\cup\\{r\\in\\mathcal U:\\operatorname{Seqs}(r)\\subseteq Q\\}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma:=\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma+\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_1:=\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma):|\\Delta|\\le1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\le1}(\\Sigma):=Q_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_1:=\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma):|\\Delta|\\le1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\le1}(\\Sigma):=Q_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\lor R)_1&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A\\rangle,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A\\lor B\\rangle):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\n(\\lor R)_2&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle B\\rangle,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A\\lor B\\rangle):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf R_J&amp;:=\\{r\\in\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\\cup\\widehat{\\mathrm{Logic}}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Seqs}(r)\\subseteq Q_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{\\lor R_1}}((\\lor R)_1)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{\\lor R_2}}((\\lor R)_2),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle Q_1,\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma\\cap Q_1,\\mathsf R_J\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma+\\{r\\in\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Seqs}(r)\\subseteq Q_1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\lor R)_1&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A\\rangle,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A\\lor B\\rangle):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\n(\\lor R)_2&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{UInf}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle B\\rangle,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A\\lor B\\rangle):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf R_J&amp;:=\\{r\\in\\widehat{\\mathrm{Struct}}_\\Sigma\\cup\\widehat{\\mathrm{Logic}}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Seqs}(r)\\subseteq Q_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{\\lor R_1}}((\\lor R)_1)\\cup\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{\\lor R_2}}((\\lor R)_2),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle Q_1,\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma\\cap Q_1,\\mathsf R_J\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma+\\{r\\in\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Seqs}(r)\\subseteq Q_1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>LJ不能只把LK的双析取前提∨R限制到单后件；现明确加入两条单析取规则。≤1条件同时使→R、∀R的侧后件为空，并使→L第一前提只有A。所有逻辑、结构与Cut都进入同一真实带标签实例接口。原书自由/约束两类变量转换为本地同类变量加捕获条件。本地无非逻辑初始式及等号公理；扩充理论必须另给相应规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"b6882ca0a0cd075f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-structural-rule","status":"resolved","id":"07987a632b1cbf1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-structural-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule-left","status":"resolved","id":"a33e42c998217a52","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule-left]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule-right","status":"resolved","id":"b054542d6df6b206","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule-right]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-right-forall","status":"resolved","id":"cf4099999609d5eb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-right-forall]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-left-exists","status":"resolved","id":"55bc01ae9fd27543","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-left-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cut-rule","status":"resolved","id":"2a94e54a928b642a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cut-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的五分量签名；$X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)$，$\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Gamma',\\Delta'$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma$，$A,B$ 遍历 $X_\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有限序列以自然数为定义域，$\\langle A\\rangle=\\{\\langle0,A\\rangle\\}$；$\\Gamma,A$ 缩写 $\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle$，$A,\\Gamma$ 缩写 $\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma$。多个逗号按次序串接。$\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma$ 是 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]] 的语法有序对。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的规则名均指推理实例关系；$\\operatorname{UInf}(s,t)=\\langle\\langle s\\rangle,t\\rangle$，$\\operatorname{BInf}(s,t,u)=\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,u\\rangle$，见 [[72-df-sequent-rule]]。","emb